00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:08.470 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  if you would have asked me two months  ago i would have told you it was  impossible for them to invent something  more boring than my social studies class  turns out i was wrong virtual social  studies on a zoom call with mr hardesty  is even  worse because with the real class i at  least got to see my best friends  sinclair and paj in fact the last time i  saw them in person  was a month ago the day of the protests  ever since then the police have been  vocal that nobody should attempt to  investigate the clown attacks on their  own  so naturally we had a plan to  investigate things on our own  while mr hardesty was droning on about  honestly i didn't even know what  sinclair page and i were chatting in a  separate window on discord  we had a plan to get some information  see while page and i aren't exactly  model students calvin sinclair is kind  of a genius  he'd been doing some of his own research  and was filling us in on his findings  he explained things in our private chat  so i started by pulling as many articles  as i could find  creating a database of all the attacks  from there i mapped everything to get a  visual idea of where these incidents are  happening  i was hoping to find a higher  concentration somewhere and maybe be  able to determine the source  podge asked him if we could see his map  and he sent over an image i opened it up  and immediately saw the pattern the  synapses in my brain were firing off and  i was ready to reveal my discovery no no  of course not  i basically had no idea what i was  looking at what do i look like bill  gates  as far as i could tell it looked like  there were attacks scattered all around  the country  other than the fact that bigger cities  and their suburbs seemed like more  likely targets there was no real pattern  that i could discern  sinclair asked us if we noticed anything  about the map and when we had no idea he  went on to inform us that he had two  major takeaways from it  excuse me who is that who just joined  right now  that was the voice of my teacher mr  hardesty apparently someone had joined  the call  and he was trying to figure out who it  was the person had their camera off and  was making a rather loud sound over the  mic  it sounded like some kind of machine  part or like a camera zooming in and out  the username was just eris i don't know  anyone at our school named eris  and that was the moment i knew we were  being eavesdropped by a clown i grabbed  the nearest weapon i could find it no no  of course not it was obviously one of  those pranks you see online where people  hack into a video conference and create  havoc  i had heard the security on this program  is basically non-existent  but this would have been the first such  intrusion that i had experienced despite  thinking it was a prank there was  something about that noise that i found  kind of creepy  maybe this class was about to actually  be interesting however  after a few minutes of nothing happening  aerys left and i turned my attention  back to our private discord chat  where sinclair would explain his  findings from mapping the data  the first major takeaway was not what i  expected he told us that all of the  attacks had taken place in the u.s  meaning that the clown attacks happening  around the country were probably from an  american organization  the second was more the type of  observation i'd expected him to say  he showed us that all of the points on  the map could be connected by major  highways and provided another graphic  with this linear connection to all the  affected schools not realizing i was  onto something i  told him that it looked like one of  those tour maps you see on a band's  website or at least one of those tour  maps you used to see on banned websites  before  organizers started cancelling all their  tours in fear of being the future  targets of clown lockdowns the situation  had really turned from paranoia to  hysteria when the clown attacks spread  from just happening in classrooms to the  point that they affected  football games stage plays and even  school band concerts which eventually  led  any tours or concerts where kids would  be in attendance to be shut down  sinclair told me he made the same  connection about the map because  of course he did he had already pulled  the data from thousands of tours that  had taken place from 2018  when the attacks started to get bad  until now apparently these ticket broker  websites also did not have the most  secure information  so he was basically able to lay these  tour maps on top of our map and see  which ones looked similar  that narrowed our search down to 97  music acts  16 book tours seven youtuber tour  things 31 comedy shows four traveling  magicians and three  country-wide circus tours furthermore  all three circus tours were put on by  the same company  an operation by the name of park du  soleil apparently that was as much  research as sinclair had time for  but he wanted to share that with us our  obvious next step would be to look into  this park du soleil  i heard the garage door open must have  been my dad getting home  i figured i'd better look like i'm  paying attention to this class when he  gets in here so i minimized our discord  chat and brought back up the zoom watch  the 1975 regulations act was still  effective excuse me  excuse me who is making that sound  it was that zooming sound that we'd  heard earlier the one that was coming  from  the heiress account only that account  was no longer in the call i scanned  through the class on my screen and it  was indicating that the sound was coming  from  calvin sinclair's microphone he was  looking around as if trying to determine  the source of the noise  i saw him typing and heard the familiar  notification sound i flipped back to our  private chat  he was telling us he could hear the  sound in his house now which was kind of  freaking him out  my dad came into the house from the  garage so i switched back to the class  and as i did so i noticed  someone was standing behind sinclair  only  it wasn't a family member at least as  far as i could tell  the person was wearing a yellow clown  suit before i could say  or do anything i saw the clown lower its  head even with sinclair so that it was  in the frame  and we could all see the bionic eye and  robotic jawline that amplified the  already terrifying  appearance of the red and white face  painted nightmare character  i once more heard that unsettling sound  as the bionic eye zoomed back out  since it was now right next to my  friend's head it startled him and he  jumped away from it as he realized how  close the intruder really was  but in that same moment the clown's  robotic jaw opened  and emitted a purple gas substance into  my friend's face which he immediately  started choking on as he fell  out of the frame the entire class was  frozen with shocked looks on their faces  it would have been easy for mr hardesty  to chalk this up to an elaborate prank  but given the climate of recent events  he sat there stunned probably not able  to process what he should say or do  i could feel my heart pounding in my  chest in the short moments that this all  went down  but what would happen next would cause  it to sink into a place in my chest that  i had never  felt it before one more time we all  heard the zoom in sound of the clown's  bionic eye  as it took control of calvin's computer  and furiously typed away  as if it were someone urgently trying to  write down an idea before the moment  passed  his screen then glitched before going  black seeing the look of fear on my  teacher's face  was strangely unsettling maybe it was  the idea that  he's supposed to be an authority figure  and he's supposed to know what to do  when something bad happens  and he didn't or maybe it was the fact  that we were no longer safe anywhere  even inside of our own homes either way  i can never forget the look that he had  the rest of the class was cancelled and  pog and i desperately tried to contact  sinclair to see if he was okay  we mulled over the idea of showing up to  get answers the police had obviously  been called so it seemed like a safe  place to be  but i think we both feared for the worst  we had just about decided on the plan  when i heard something that made me  freeze  i slowly turned in horror to see that  there was someone standing  at my window the same clown that had  attacked sinclair 30 minutes ago was now  coming  after me my head spun and my insides did  somersaults  i realized what must have happened it  was somehow using the computers to find  us in real life  it started when aerys had joined the  zoom call  that's when it found sinclair's location  then it used his computer to get to the  next in line which  may have been me or maybe there was one  before me who even knows at this point  in a panic i fumbled my way out of the  chair knocking it over as i did so  i didn't turn my back on the cyber clown  which caused me to go full horror movie  protagonist and slip and stumble my way  away from the window  but it was also the reason that i was  looking in that direction when  something lashed out from outside the  window frame and struck the clown around  its left eye the non-bionic one  the clown let out an inhuman scream and  fell to the ground  that's when i saw my dad wielding an old  hockey stick from the garage  he whacked the clown several times on  the ground on the third hit  the stick seemed to get caught on  something and stuck in place he tried to  pull it back and finally pulled it hard  enough for the blade to break away from  the handle  we would later find the blade totally  deformed in the yard as if it were a  chewed up toothpick  my dad came back inside and locked us in  the basement as he called the police  we didn't see the cyber clown again the  police showed up collected the evidence  and  that was about it as they were probably  off to go make a report on the next  clown attack  i tried to listen in in the short time  they were there one of them mentioned  something about the mayor planning to  issue a mandatory stay at home order for  all kids  and how that idea wasn't gonna do much  good if the attacks are now happening in  residential neighborhoods  we never found out what happened to  sinclair he's still  missing things have only gotten worse  i talked to pog again tonight he too was  shaken but we both agreed that the  police weren't doing enough  we wanted to continue the investigation  that sinclair started  and that began with looking into the  circus park du soleil  we found out that it was started in the  mid-2000s by a guy named otis park  so that's where our search would have to  begin i haven't seen another clown since  that day  but sometimes in the dead of night  i still think i hear that sound  thanks for listening to all dainty  creepypasta  your total today comes out to 1975. but  if you like this video right now i'll  waive that fee and give you  everything you just listened to  absolutely free  remember to subscribe to cz's world for  new horrors every week  ring that death bell for notifications  and i'll see you in the next one  assuming we both survived  you

